    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The AKU Academic Quality Framework was implemented in Pakistan following its implementation in East Africa. For the first time, on September 20-23, 2016, international experts reviewed Medical College graduate programmes in Pakistan. This review entailed a cluster review of 3 masters programmes: Epidemiology and Biostatistics, Health Policy and Management, and Health Professions Education.",
